OL,3,AWe must heed warnings of AI tech
OL,4,Adevelopers, says UK minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government must "heed the
OL,7,Fwarnings" of "those who are at the
OL,8,Fforefront" of developing artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI) technology, a senior
OL,10,Fminister will say later.
OL,12,FFirst Secretary of State Louise Haigh
OL,13,Fwill address the growing anxiety over
OL,14,FAI safety when she speaks at the TUC
OL,15,Fcongress on Tuesday.
OL,17,FShe is expected to say the government
OL,18,Fis "ready to work with international
OL,19,Fpartners" to prioritise public safety
OL,20,Fand national security.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
